    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through worlds of wonder in <strong>Art Strikers!</strong>\u00a0The long awaited sequel to Axe Girl starring Paper, a brilliant young artist with the power to bring her art to life. One day, Paper and her friends were at an art exhibit when suddenly a strange portal transports each of them to a different universe! Help Paper fight her way through several challenging art themed shoot-em-up levels, find her lost friends, and discover what it truly means to be an artist.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced side-scrolling bullet-hell gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 beautifully crafted levels inspired by various real life artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An &quot;Art Strike&quot; mechanic that allows you to unleash powerful art-based attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish hand drawn 2D sprites to compliment the art theme.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic soundtrack courtesy of our two awesome composers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling story exploring themes of self doubt and self actualization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra modes unlocked after completion of the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References you probably won't get.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384330/extras/5c6c6b2f61f647ba2cbba3229c63dd75.poster.avif?t=1736204232\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384330/extras/5c6c6b2f61f647ba2cbba3229c63dd75.webm?t=1736204232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384330/extras/5c6c6b2f61f647ba2cbba3229c63dd75.mp4?t=1736204232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soar through worlds of wonder in <strong>Art Strikers!</strong>\u00a0The long awaited sequel to Axe Girl starring Paper, a brilliant young artist with the power to bring her art to life. One day, Paper and her friends were at an art exhibit when suddenly a strange portal transports each of them to a different universe! Help Paper fight her way through several challenging art themed shoot-em-up levels, find her lost friends, and discover what it truly means to be an artist.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced side-scrolling bullet-hell gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 beautifully crafted levels inspired by various real life artworks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An &quot;Art Strike&quot; mechanic that allows you to unleash powerful art-based attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish hand drawn 2D sprites to compliment the art theme.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fantastic soundtrack courtesy of our two awesome composers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compelling story exploring themes of self doubt and self actualization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra modes unlocked after completion of the main story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >References you probably won't get.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384330/extras/5c6c6b2f61f647ba2cbba3229c63dd75.poster.avif?t=1736204232\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384330/extras/5c6c6b2f61f647ba2cbba3229c63dd75.webm?t=1736204232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3384330/extras/5c6c6b2f61f647ba2cbba3229c63dd75.mp4?t=1736204232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
